+**In-context VERIFIED-PATTERN library (operator-directed 2026-06-28, `arc_pattern_library` + `arc_incontext_pattern_proposal_ab`):** genuinely-untried lever (give the small LLM a TOP-K of verified worked+failed patterns as IN-CONTEXT reasoning exemplars, NOT weight pre-training; distinct from the nulled weight-transfer exp4318/4342, single-recipe router exp4556, efficiency-retrieval exp4933). Built + verified-not-done-before + LOO-tested. **RESULT — BOTH HALVES NOW CLOSED:**
+
+- **Behavior-pattern half = POWERED NULL (settled 2026-06-28).** The operator directed isolating the RE'd SEMANTIC solve knowledge (registry `win_condition`/`action_model`/`gotchas` + solve trajectories + `dead_ends`), dropping the obfuscated source. Powered run: **n=19 LOO games, M=5 samples/arm**, source EXCLUDED. The in-context exemplars do **NOT** reliably shift the proposed opening toward the held-out winner: execution-relevant **leading delta +0.042, CI95 [-0.095, +0.211]** (spans 0); degeneracy-robust **LCS delta -0.076, CI95 [-0.208, +0.026]** (spans 0, leans slightly negative); `exemplars_help=False`. The apparent gains concentrate on all-click `[6,6,6,6]` winners where exemplars coincidentally nudge toward clicks (ft09 +1.2, lf52 +0.6), offset by hurts elsewhere (su15 -0.6; m0r0/re86/sk48 strongly negative LCS) — coincidence, not transferable reasoning. Matches `WALL_IS_HIDDEN_STATE` (winning prefix is interaction-dependent, never enumerable from the first frame) and arc_solve_learning.py:114 (few-shotting a weak 9B below a confidence bar can degrade).
+- **Source-code half = OBFUSCATION-BLOCKED (independent).** ARC-AGI-3 public game source has random/scrubbed identifiers; 13/25 source-derived patterns are semantically empty, so source patterns carry ~0 transferable semantics. Not fixable without a de-obfuscation-aware extractor; not the thing the powered run tested.
+
+Earlier n=8/M=3 read was "AMBIGUOUS/underpowered"; the M=5/n=19 run supersedes it as a clean powered null on the behavior half. Artifact `results/arc_incontext_pattern_proposal_ab.json` (substrate=aggregation over 19 per-game live-LLM checkpoints; adversarial_verify clean; verifier_is_oracle=False; solve_provenance=development_proxy).
 
